  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Business College Mitrovica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationellt Business College Mitrovica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SPARK ska bygga och driva ett internationellt Business College i Mitrovica. Den 2-&#xe5;riga inkluderande yrkesh&#xf6;gskoleutbildningen riktar sig till ungdomar fr&#xe5;n Kosovos etniska majoritet och minoriteter och skapar d&#xe4;rigenom f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r integration. Insatsen bidrar till en &#xf6;kad andel unga med relevant yrkesutbildning och chans till att f&#xe5; kvalificerade jobb.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPARK will construct and implement the International Business College in Mitrovica, a 2-year inclusive higher educational vocational training. The training brings together youth from Kosovo&apos;s majority and minority communities thus improving integration, as well as it has a positive effect on the number of trained youth and their employability.</narrative>
  </description>
